Z||000022||chester||09-20-2001||10:40 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cozmo:<P> <P>It's still "in progress", today was the first day I had all the body panels on it    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>BobC[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I'd like some info on the targa top. Did you convert it or was it that way when you bought it? Kit?  Input....need input!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Nice car!<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigline.jpg">    <BR>Modified 2.8<BR>2.5" Drop<BR>11" Brakes<BR>17" Revolutions<BR>RCC Coilover Suspension<p>[This message has been edited by chester (edited 09-20-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000023||Cozmo||09-20-2001||12:17 PM||||Thanks for all the great comments!<BR>The MR2 wing is temporary, I'm getting a DGP wraparound wing from one of our club members to go on it permanantly.<BR>The hood scoop uses the metal dash grill piece, it's similiar in concept to Orief's and Archie's.<BR>Still have to fab some side scoops, flushmount headlights and a rear deck vent and then it will be ready for paint.  I'm thinking pearl white overall including aero stuff.  Going to leave the top and windshield pillars gloss black and severely tint the windows.  Maybe 2 5" wide black racing stripes also.<BR>I bought the car as a Targa, it's a pretty professional job not a clue as to who made it tho.<BR>Aus, I'll post some pics of the underframe this weekend while I've got it jacked up (got to fix the emergency brake mess... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> )<BR>Boy, I'm glad I didn't sell it... It was in really bad shape when I got it and I didn't think I had the time or expertise to restore it properly.  Thanks to this forum and all the very cool members for all the help and info to get it this far!<P>BobC||||reg||1
